SUMMARY:Information: Tottenham Hale Station: Big Bang Concert at Tottenham 
 Hotspur Stadium on Saturday 26 September (2000 KO): Tottenham Hale station
  is expected to be extremely busy between 1400 and 1600 and between 2200 
 and 2300. You may find it easier to use Northumberland Park station where 
 additional trains will call before and after the match
